			"date": "2023-01-20T15:45:02.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> For those of us that very rarely use npm, and have been poking about on the canary, how does one `npm update` and get the beta, instead of the latest Canary?</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "109722314837930321",
			"parentId": "109722304748968760",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/109722314837930321",
