			},
			"date": "2023-01-20T15:47:37.565Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mstdn.social/@mattwilcox\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>mattwilcox</span></a></span> `npm install @11ty/eleventy@beta` in your project directory will do the trick! You can check in your package.json after or by running `npx @11ty/eleventy --version`</p>",
